  "description": "SEED contract for the CSS/DOM conformance fixture case \"focus-ring-declared-style-only\" (interaction-states). The fixture varies CSS CONSTRUCTS, not prop spaces, so the prop space is deliberately EMPTY: every axis the capture would enumerate is held at nothing, and the whole measurement is the computed truth of one mounted rendering. Construct: a link whose focus ring is spelled ONLY as a KEYWORD flip — the rest plane carries `outline-width: 3px; outline-style: none` with no `outline-color` of its own (so it computes to `currentColor`), and `:focus-visible` sets `outline-style: solid; outline-width: 2px; outline-offset: 2px` and nothing else COMPUTED-ENRICHED (extract/computed): unlabeled styled channels minted from computed-style capture of @ds-contracts/conformance@0.1.0 in headless Chromium 151.0.7922.34; overflow channels in the sibling extension file.",
